  "title": "Quick and Easy Potato Casserole",
  "description": "This potato casserole is made with cream of chicken soup for extra creaminess! Plus lots of Cheddar cheese and sour cream for a bit of tang.",
  "authors": [
    "FOXWORTH"
  ],
